elease, in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It now reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open at SEV2 against payments-worker and has paged on-call. The summary records the rollback and flags that payments-api is still unhealthy and unrolled.\n\nThe 18% error rate on payments-api is identical to payments-worker's, so it may be a downstream effect or a second problem. Someone should confirm whether payments-api v5.1.0 is still contributing to the errors. If it is, a rollback to v5.0.0 would need to go through the usual approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}